    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Risk your life in a deadly game</h2>A psycho has kidnapped you and five other quality control employees from the factory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/ec1e71420808f0f3b158e9cc3ac3e0aa.poster.avif?t=1729082449\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/ec1e71420808f0f3b158e9cc3ac3e0aa.webm?t=1729082449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/ec1e71420808f0f3b158e9cc3ac3e0aa.mp4?t=1729082449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The prisoner's dilemma</h2>You are about to play a tournament based on the rules of the prisoner's dilemma.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/93659511566f0ddafe75cf2527e2ec00.poster.avif?t=1729082449\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/93659511566f0ddafe75cf2527e2ec00.webm?t=1729082449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/93659511566f0ddafe75cf2527e2ec00.mp4?t=1729082449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt to different opponents</h2>It's your choice: cooperate and try to escape together or betray and save your own skin.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the real culprit</h2>Find out who is truly responsible for your misfortunes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use items</h2>Various items will help you get out of unforeseen situations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/d9d0f3e09ca2e3619a36b75256c59002.poster.avif?t=1729082449\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/d9d0f3e09ca2e3619a36b75256c59002.webm?t=1729082449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/d9d0f3e09ca2e3619a36b75256c59002.mp4?t=1729082449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your choice</h2>Good luck.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/3e48d6f0d5c4c6c8520796545d2abcb4.poster.avif?t=1729082449\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/3e48d6f0d5c4c6c8520796545d2abcb4.webm?t=1729082449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242410/extras/3e48d6f0d5c4c6c8520796545d2abcb4.mp4?t=1729082449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
